\ BUFSET.SEQ    Buffer set for system speed.            F-PC native port

\ Native port: the original timed a PAUSE loop for 1/10 second at every
\ cold start to size the read buffer and to calibrate the busy loop in MS.
\ Neither makes sense on a host: the buffer gets IBLIMIT bytes and MS
\ watches the clock (centisecond resolution), calling PAUSE.
\ TODO-PORT: make MS a host sleep built-in (kernel-design.md 6, MS =
\ host_sleep_ms) so it doesn't spin.

32000 VALUE IBLIMIT             \ upper limit of max size IBLEN can be

VARIABLE FUDGE   84 FUDGE !     \ unused now, kept for old code

: CS-NOW        ( -- n1 )       \ centiseconds since midnight
                GETTIME T>B DROP ;

: MS   ( n -- )
                9 + 10 / CS-NOW         \ -- centiseconds start
                begin   pause
                        CS-NOW over - dup 0<
                        if      8640000 +       \ past midnight
                        then    2 pick < 0=
                until   2drop ;

: bufsize-init  ( --- )
                iblimit dup =: iblen    \ set buffer length value
                            =: ibfull   \ full size of available buffer space
                defers initstuff ;      \ continue with initialization

\ The original calibration, no longer used:
comment:
: bufsize-init  ( --- )
                ['] 1+ is pause-func    \ setup to count iterations
                0 1 tenths              \ 1 tenth delay to calibrate time edge
                drop                    \ and discard first try results.
                4                       \ start with a small offset for 8088's
                1 tenths                \ Time it again, this time for a
                                        \ FULL 1/10 of a second.
                ['] noop is pause-func  \ Clear the pause function.
                dup 90 *D               \ Use double number to allow math
                                        \ range for 25 and 33 mhz machines.
                iblimit 0 dmin drop     \ Limit result to IBLIMIT bytes.
                dup =: iblen            \ set buffer length value
                    =: ibfull           \ full size of available buffer space
                1000 1120 */ fudge !    \ calibrate MS to system clock.
                defers initstuff ;      \ continue with initialization
comment;

  ' bufsize-init is initstuff

